ntil end of turn.\\n{4}{R}: Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', '{1}{R}: Lightning Wolf gains first strike until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}, {T}: Draw a card. Transform Mysterious Tome.', '{2}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{2}: Stuffed Bear becomes a 4/4 green Bear artifact creature until end of turn.', '{2}{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Draw a card, then transform Ecstatic Awakener. Activate only once each turn.', "{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Target opponent loses life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{2}{B}: Return Persistent Specimen from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}{G}: Pestilent Wolf gains deathtouch until end of turn.', '{2}{R}, {T}: Ballista Watcher deals 1 damage to any target.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', "{2}{R}: Ballista Wielder deals 1 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't block this turn.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)", '{2}{R}{G}: Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', '{2}{U}: Exile target creature card from your graveyard and put a +1/+1 counter on Patchwork Crawler.\\nPatchwork Crawler has all activated abilities of all creature cards exiled with it.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Silver Bolt: It deals 3 damage to target creature. If a Werewolf is dealt damage this way, destroy it.', '{3}{R}, {T}: Runebound Wolf deals damage equal to the number of Wolves and Werewolves you control to target opponent.', "{3}{R}: Target creature can't block this turn.", '{T}, Discard a creature card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Put an omen counter on Foreboding Statue.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if there are three or more omen counters on Foreboding Statue, untap it, then transform it.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{T}: Add two mana of any one color. Spend this mana only to cast spells from your graveyard.\\n{G}{U}, {T}, Exile Rootcoil Creeper: Return target card with flashback you own from exile to your hand.', '{T}: Add two mana of any one color.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a soul counter on Hostile Hostel. Then if there are three or more soul counters on it, remove those counters, transform it, then untap it. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Field of Ruin: Destroy target nonbasic land an opponent controls. Each player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield, then shuffles.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Vampire spell.\\n{5}, {T}: Create a Blood token. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each Vampire you control. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {U}. Spend this mana only to pay a disturb cost or cast an instant or sorcery spell.', '{T}: Draw a card, then exile a card from your hand face down. You may look at that card for as long as it remains exiled. You may pay {4}{U}{U}. If you do, transform Jacob Hauken, Inspector.', '{T}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn. You gain 1 life. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Voltaic Visionary deals 2 damage to you. Exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nWhen you play a card exiled with Voltaic Visionary, transform Voltaic Visionary.', '{U}, Sacrifice Malevolent Hermit: Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {3}.\\nDisturb {2}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)', "{W}, Exile three cards from your graveyard: Fleeting Spirit gains first strike until end of turn.\\nDiscard a card: Exile Fleeting Spirit. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
flavor: ['"A creature of stone was never meant to fly. And I see the Ulvenwald agrees with me."\\n—Halana, Kessig ranger', '"Ah, Jerren. You\'ve been such a faithful, useful insect."', '"Aha! Yes! Now I hear it, the beautiful poetry of the lights in the sky. I must reach the moon and ask what it all means!"', '"And now I\'m coming for you!"', '"And you were almost finished with that ritual, weren\'t you, darling? How very rude of me. To make it up to you, I\'ll send you an invitation to my wedding."', '"Aren\'t you going to invite me in?"', '"Aren\'t you going to offer me a drink?"', '"At least I won\'t become one of . . . those things."', '"Bah! As if I had time to preserve everything."', '"Begone, moon-cursed! These folk are no prey of yours."', '"Blasted drake\'s interfering with the conductivity again. Garl! Go chase it away."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"By ancient magics, by angels\' grace, we will survive this night."', '"C\'mon, fiend. I\'ll carve you up like a Harvesttide ham."', '"Careful now. Don\'t want to get the seeds stuck to your feelers like last time."', '"Careful, this thing\'s dangerous. Wouldn\'t want anyone getting hurt."', '"Creatures of the night dissolve like shadows in the light of faith."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"Day 77: The homunculus within the crystal continues to mimic my every movement. I wonder what they are writing?"\\n—Laboratory notes of Yzlkpk', '"Devils need no reason to stir up chaos. The chaos itself is their reward."\\n—Rem Karolus, Fiendslayer', '"Do not confuse justice with mercy."\\n—Odric, Order of Saint Traft', '"Do not try to negotiate with me, human. You want power? This is the price."\\n—Ormendahl', '"Do you like it, Sister? Its dreadful visage was inspired by your own."', '"Do you smell that, friends? Fear and despair."', '"Don\'t worry everyone—I hear hoofbeats! The Gavony Riders are coming to save us!"\\n—Adin, Moorland villager', '"Even in our darkest times, Avacyn\'s light still guides us."', '"Even in times of brutal darkness, never mistake beauty and delicacy for weakness."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"Even steel and stone return to Ghrin-Danu in time."\\n—Katilda, Dawnhart Prime', '"Every day a Voldaren draws breath is a day I cannot rest."', '"Far from home, little one? I know the feeling."', '"Fool! Can\'t you see the tide has turned against you?"', '"Forget your human ancestors. You\'re part of my family now."', '"Forgive my manners. It\'s been so long since I had a guest for dinner."', '"Geralf\'s prowess continues to grow. He can now replicate my own creations with near-perfect accuracy."\\n—Ludevic\'s laboratory notes', '"Gotcha."', '"Great Ormendahl, I kneel before you, a fragment of your will, a servant of your tyrrany. I beg you, release the strength within me!"', '"Ha! They fall for it every time."', '"Help! I\'m not a zombie! Let me out!"', '"Help! There\'s been a horrible murder!"', '"Here you go. Can\'t have you sleeping through your own wedding day."', '"Honorable tactics are for honorable foes. These werewolves are preying on innocent travelers. I\'ll stab them in the back while they sleep if I have to."', '"Humans throw rice and release doves at their weddings? How quaint."', '"Hunter\'s fire" was meant for slaying monsters in the Ulvenwald, but that never stopped Ralen from showing it off.', '"I escaped, so why do I still feel like I\'m being watched?"\\n—Gregel, militia leader', '"I fell to my knees. I called out to Sigarda. And then I saw my tormentors blaze with blessed sunlight."', '"I never did enjoy studying."', '"I never get any knitting done, but I don\'t entirely mind."\\n—Lorn, Lambholt innkeeper', '"I noticed you were short on party favors, so I brought my own."\\n—Higa, slayer-captain of Gatstaf', '"I refuse to die before I see the sun rise again."', '"I see someone tried to stop you, my pet. How delightful."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"I used to have hired hands, but I discovered they make better waitstaff with the rest of the body attached."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"I was a mere cutpurse until I learned the going rate for fresh corpses."', '"I would welcome her into my pack with honor."\\n—Arlinn Kord', '"I\'ll lead."', '"If I wanted all the parts to match, I wouldn\'t have become a stitcher."\\n—Barton, stitcher', '"If I\'m going, I\'m taking you with me!"', '"If my hypothesis is correct . . ."', '"If you hear a groaning noise in the cellar, don\'t investigate. Don\'t split up. Just lock the door and barricade it."\\n—Emili, guard captain', '"If you\'re lost in a storm, follow a gryff. They always know which way calmer waters lie."\\n—Geor, Havengul fisher', '"If you\'re not refining your tastes, what\'s the point of living forever?"', '"In case any of you new recruits were wondering, this is why we don\'t use mass graves anymore."\\n—Kerren of the Mausoleum Guards', '"Is this twisted ceremony simply a mockery of the human rite, or has Olivia fallen for her own charade?"\\n—Sorin Markov', '"It has no need of wealth in the afterlife. It steals and kills purely for its own spiteful amusement."\\n—Kaya', '"It is our duty to bring the Blessed Sleep to the dead, even if they resist that gift."\\n—Grete, Order of Saint Traft', '"It was Sigarda who lifted me from despair and gave me the strength to fight on."', '"It won\'t bring them back, but it will bring me peace."', '"It\'s a perfect partnership. My village is safe from wolf attacks, and she gets to eat any vampires we catch."', '"It\'s all in the follow-through."', '"It\'s creepy out here, isn\'t it, boy? I always feel like someone\'s watching us."', '"It\'s not that I didn\'t expect some defiance, but I did hope it wouldn\'t be so heavily armed."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"Just hold still. I\'ll help you."', '"Keep master busy with new bits or else maybe she wonders if I\'m made of bits too."', '"Keep your heels down and bend at the hips as your mount takes flight. She\'ll do the rest."\\n—Anders, cathar drillmaster', '"Lady Anje sends her regards. I\'ll carve the rest of her message into your skin."', '"Leave behind this sorrow of this body. Be blessed, being of light."', '"Let\'s see my brother\'s stitched-up little toys compete with this."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Like a thousand candles fighting back the darkness, we are strongest when we stand together."', '"Like us, the morning fights for survival."', '"Madness can\'t touch a mind ignited by genius."', '"May I have this dance?"', '"May the ocean take it"\\n—Nephalia expression meaning\\n"good riddance"', '"Me neither."', '"Morning light, morning light,\\nChase away the fears of night."\\n—Gavony children\'s rhyme', '"My angel is the flint, and I am her steel."', '"My little winged friends tell me which of these townsfolk are worth tasting for myself."', '"No, no, it\'s just a murder of crows, not an omen of murder . . . I think."\\n—York, Kessig tracker', '"Obviously it\'s dangerous, but I\'ve never seen anything like it. This could be an entirely new species! I say we follow it."\\n—Halana, Kessig ranger', '"Oh no. Oh no. Oh no. Oh no, again!"\\n—Beltstad, cathar recruit, last words', '"Oh, thank the angels. It\'s not a werewolf, just a regular wo—"\\n—Bruno, Ulvenwald guide, last words', '"Olivia Voldaren has faith only in herself. We answer to a higher calling."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"On this night, the dark will fear us."', '"Once you\'ve tasted demon blood, you\'ll wonder why you ever settled for human."', '"One raven is a bad omen. Two are a curse. I don\'t know what this is, but it can\'t be good."\\n—Verna, priest of Sigarda', '"One vampire for every family member I\'ve lost."', '"Our bodies may lie slain, but perhaps we can still complete the ritual. I\'d rather not spend my afterlife in this wretched eternal night."', '"Our coven finds strength in nature and purpose in serving our communities."', '"Our kind has taken my gift for granted. It is time to correct that folly."', '"Our world may be dark, but there\'s still plenty to see."', '"Please, my friends, help yourselves to the help."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"Pleased to meet you, Seven."', '"Remember to come back in a few years when that fungus has died off. Then we\'ll see what\'s in the chest."\\n—Old Rutstein', '"Rise, my pretty thing. Why rot in the river when you can serve at my bidding?"', '"Run! It\'s coming for us! Eventually!"\\n—Yaster, Havengul shopkeeper', '"Sleep? I can sleep when I\'m dead!"', '"Speak my name thrice, and be rewarded."', '"Spend too much time scanning the shadows for evil and you\'ll never see the beauty our world has to offer."\\n—Katilda, Dawnhart Prime', '"Stand strong. We will reclaim the dawn."', '"Stay in the light. I don\'t know what lurks in those shadows, and I\'d like to keep it that way."', '"Stensia blazes with new heat. Nephalia\'s tides are chaotic. And everywhere, this unnatural frost. The land is sending a warning."\\n—Katilda, Dawnhart Prime', '"Sturdy nails make for sound sleep."\\n—Cosper Lowe of the Silbern Guard', '"Thank you, Grandmother. I love you too."', '"The angels may have abandoned us, but Ghrin-Danu has not."', '"The balance of day and night is shattered. We must find the Moonsilver Key."', '"The cathars have taught me many things, but I will never forget the hard, honest work that first callused my hands."', '"The forests of this world are unafraid to assert themselves."\\n—Wrenn', '"The jaw bone\'s connected to the skull bone. The skull bone\'s connected to the . . . uh . . . hook thingy."\\n—Garl, sticher\'s assistant', '"There\'s nothing like a good meal to really lift the spirit."', '"These seeds waited faithfully for the sun to rise again. Now, their patience is rewarded."\\n—Wrenn', '"This Tovolar is no brainless brute. He sends his howling minions to terrorize a village for months. Sleepless nights and fear take their toll. Only then, when morale is at its worst, does he strike."\\n—Barnes, village watch', '"This is your only warning, alchemist. The secrets of the sea are not yours to behold. Lord Krothuss will not be so merciful next time."\\n—Runo Stromkirk', '"This still doesn\'t make you the brains of the operation."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Thraben belongs to the living. I will not rest until it is cleansed."', '"Tonight, we can be anything."', '"Tread carefully. You remember what happened in the last quiet, peaceful clearing."\\n—Halana, to Alena', '"Vampires have done nothing but take from us. Tonight, we reclaim what\'s ours!"', '"Wait! That\'s no gryff—at least not anymore."\\n—Geor, Havengul fisher', '"We are not here to mourn their loss. We are here to celebrate their lives."\\n—Vesna, Dawnhart witch', '"We can go into the dark hand-in-hand or alone. I know which I prefer."', '"We can wait like helpless children for a hero, or we can gather our courage and *be* the heroes. Who\'s with me?"', '"We cannot escape change, but with faith and fortitude, we can mold it to our liking."\\n—Marel, Dawnhart witch', '"We spend our entire existence pursuing the joy of our first night\'s feast."\\n—Anje Falkenrath', '"We survived the Travails! Killer angels! Horrors from beyond the moon! Now some big werewolves think they can scare us? Let \'em try."', '"We\'re not at odds with the woods. How could we be, when we share so many enemies?"\\n—Marel, Dawnhart witch', '"We\'ve learned enough! I say we run."\\n—Alena, Kessig trapper', '"Welcome to the greatest show in Kessig!"', '"Well done, young fool, well done! Now for your reward."', '"Werewolves leave messy trails. Easy to follow. Hard to forget."', '"Werewolves leave tracks. Vampires leave wrung-out corpses. This is something else."\\n—Paulin, trapper of Somberwald', '"What has been looted can be restored. The church lives on within us."', '"When a werewolf charges, you\'ll only have time for one shot. Best make it count."\\n—Captain Eberheart', '"When lost souls wander into the woods, the wilds have a way of showing them who they really are."\\n—Rahilda, Vildin-Pack alpha', '"Wherever there is life, there is power for one who knows the old ways."', '"Wipe your chin, child. We can\'t have Olivia thinking we\'re uncivilized."\\n—Anje Falkenrath', '"With Avacyn gone, I no longer knew who to pray to. Alone, I wept for a sister who would never return."', '"Works every time! Well, every time they don\'t explode, anyway."\\n—Barton, stitcher', '"Works every time."\\n—Halana, Kessig ranger', '"You and me, we\'re not built for captivity."', '"You are one of the few to whom we offer our blessing. What fool would reject immortality?"\\n—Runo Stromkirk', '"You can always tell who\'s new from the screaming."\\n—Tinua, Skirsdag cultist', '"You can join me or feed me. Choose fast."', '"You could see the spirits all along, couldn\'t you? Well, now I can too."', '"You have my word. You\'ll see no wolf attacks while we\'re around!"', '"You look cold, dearie."', '"You want that venom? Collect it yourself! I\'m not losing another pair of dragonhide gloves."\\n—Old Rutstein', '"Your guard attacked me. He got what was coming to him."', '. . . "What\'s bugging you?"', '. . . but she knew it would be rude to refuse.', '. . . does not always mean living in peace.', '...knowing their hatchlings are more fearsome than anything else that might come along.', 'A barricade only buys time. So the wealthy buy more barricades.', 'A carriage crafted from the finest materials. Horses bred from the finest stock. Skulls taken from the finest foes.', 'A dragon is born. A province burns.', 'A duel to first blood means something very different when a vampire is involved.', 'A few townsfolk had their suspicions, but none dared accuse him openly.', 'A few weed-choked gourd patches are all that remain of the proud, thriving farms that once blanketed the province.', "A heavy net doesn't always mean a good catch.", 'A loyal crew sticks together, even after death.', 'A moment of distraction, an hour off course.', 'A soulless husk of endless hunger.', 'A stitcher looks at their creation and sees the result of years of study and hours of toil. A devil sees a new plaything.', 'A tragic moment pushed him to a blasphemous act.', 'A wolf pup is always dangerous, because a wolf pup is never alone.', "After Uda's hat boutique in Selhoff was destroyed by werewolves, she relocated outside of town and took up a new type of sewing.", 'After the Travails, Runechanters set about repairing twisted symbols of Avacyn as the first step in restoring faith in the Church.', 'After weeks of unending darkness, a glimpse of dawn was all the people of Stensia needed to rekindle their will to fight.', 'All across Gavony, in shuttered bedrooms and locked barns, young people seek the answers their elders failed to provide.', 'All druids seek to preserve nature, but some go about it in rather unusual ways.', 'All his old grudges suddenly seemed laughably petty. So he laughed.', 'Ancient evils dwell within the burning chasm called the Ashmouth, ever ready to devour those foolish enough to travel alone.', "And they're more than happy to share the wealth.", 'Arvon was ecstatic to offer his blood to such a captivating creature.', 'As Sigarda and Sorin battled, Arlinn and Teferi recovered the key from the Markov catacombs.', 'As long as evil threatens his town, the Blessed Sleep can wait.', "As long as the sun is up, you'll only lose your purse.", "As the flames consumed the killer, his eyes remained fixed on the executioner's face, his hands twitching like angry spiders.", 'As the natural cycle of day and night grew twisted, old powers stirred deep in the Ulvenwald.', 'As the sand eroded, a faint sound could be heard whirling under the ground.', 'As werewolf attacks increased, brutal weapons not seen since the Travails were dusted off and put to work.', 'At the edge of night, on the cusp of winter, the allure of fire grows ever stronger.', 'Aunt and Uncle Greyfield loved dinner guests.', 'Autonomy is only skin deep.', 'Before the officiant even had a chance to ask if anyone objected to the Voldaren-Markov union, Arlinn made her opinion known.', 'Beneath the waves, lost gods stir in their slumber.', 'Better potent than predictable.', 'Between stitchers, cultists, and scavengers, corpses are in high demand.', 'Bones cracked, flesh split apart, and the screams of euphoric agony gave way to unholy laughter.', 'Brimming with power from their disrupted ritual, the Dawnhart witches lashed out at the werewolf intruders.', 'But every story ended the same way: the countryside was captured in the icy grip of winter and darkened by eternal night.', 'By the end of the festival, it was the only thing still grinning.', 'By the sixth day of darkness, the lake was more blood than water.', "Chandra, Teferi, and Arlinn sought clues to the Moonsilver Key's whereabouts while Kaya dispatched the spirits obstructing their path.", 'Charity is rare on Innistrad, but kindness is always repaid.', "Cleaning up his life's work was his afterlife's work.", 'Come nightfall, they were the ones fleeing in terror.', 'Created to capture the spark of genius for later use.', "Cries of panic echo along Kessig's narrow ravines as howlpacks herd their prey.", 'Deadly mushrooms litter these woods, each waiting for an errant footstep to release its noxious spores.', 'Death is no impediment to dinner.', 'Devils find human dwellings to be oppressively cold, dark, and unburnt.', 'Die beneath a tree, wake up a part of it.', "Do the candleguides' heads turn to follow you as you pass, or is it merely a trick of the flickering light?", 'Drownyard floods and unnatural frost made the once peaceful boardwalk deceptively treacherous.', 'Even in death, he casts his lines, forever fishing for reasons long forgotten.', 'Even vampires know to travel faster when they hear howling in the Geier Reach passes.', 'Even when he strikes, the only sound is the snap of jaws through bone.', "Even within the chapel's hallowed halls, the devils' laughter pierced his prayers.", "Ever since the ritual, Ryla didn't have an appetite at the dinner table, but her long walks in the forest always seemed to satiate her hunger.", "Faith is a cathar's greatest weapon, but a sword of blessed silver is a close second.", 'Far from the bloodsoaked wedding, unseen by human eyes, a long-slumbering force arose to protect its home.', 'Few take kindly to being put in their place, especially if their place is the grave.', 'First darkness falls. Then it burrows in.', 'For every eye gouged out, two blinked open.', "For the more refined vampire, breaking a victim's will is far more satisfying than simply taking their blood.", 'Frequent, violent storms shape the Nephalia coastline, sculpting cliffs and caves where monsters often lurk.', 'Frog is the sincerest form of flattery.', 'From every kill, a gruesome trophy.', 'From the moment they arrived, wedding guests were met with a pageant of wealth and excess.', "Frozen is frozen, whether it's with cold, terror, or both.", 'Furious to find the workshop empty, the starving vampires flew into a frenzy.', "Geists have a knack for showing up wherever they're least expected.", 'Geor was determined to stay out until he got a bite from something big.', "Griselbrand's defeat did not mark the end of the Skirsdag cult. They simply turned their worship to the next demon to emerge from the shadows bearing offers of power.", 'He blends seamlessly into the forest, waiting silently for his prey.', 'He raged not just against vampires, but against civilization itself.', "He rides in agitated circles, snapping orders at servants who've long since found their peace.", "He rose from the graf for every cobbler, tanner, and fool who'd been slaughtered in the parish—and they rose and shambled after him.", 'He swore to protect the Moorlands. A little thing like death was no excuse to break his oath.', 'He wanders the Moorlands hoping to one day chop off a head worthy of replacing his own.', "He was one masked stranger among many. Blending in was child's play.", 'Heida allowed herself a moment of satisfaction as she watched the beast fall, then turned to seek another foe. It would be a long, long night.', 'Her cauldron refilled, she settled in to wait for the next unsuspecting traveler to knock at her door.', 'Her claws are another matter.', 'Her face shines with youthful innocence.', 'Her grand wedding had one goal: to unite the vampire bloodlines under her rule.', "Her hunger won't be sated until she's tasted every bird on Innistrad.", "Hiring an experienced wilderness guide isn't cheap, but it costs less than a search party. Or a funeral.", 'In Kessig, even celebration wears a fearsome face.', 'In lieu of payment, he was granted permission to devour any unauthorized visitors.', "In the adrenaline-fueled chaos, she hadn't even felt the bite.", 'In the arena, vampires set aside all pretense of honor or civilization and fight like the predators they know themselves to be.', 'In the maze-like passages of the Erdwal, a wrong turn can be fatal.', "Innistrad's best archers are trained by the Quiver of Kessig, an order of cathars who specialize in ranged combat.", 'It can barely feel the sword anymore.', 'It conducts the souls of the righteous to their blessed rest and the spirits of the evil to justice.', "It doesn't need to breathe, but the suit does help keep the parts together.", 'It herds souls toward eternal torment.', 'It knows one fundamental truth: bodies belong in graves.', 'It may have been a mistake to give them minds of their own.', 'It takes a taxidermist of unusual skill to cleanly stuff and mount a beast without severing its primal, predatory drive.', 'It waited on the barn wall for decades, forgotten, looking for the perfect opportunity.', 'It was a family reunion to die for.', 'Ivold gasped in surprise. Either a very strange insect had crawled onto one of the lenses or he was seeing geists at last!', 'Ivold was aghast when his device revealed the full scope of the geist infestation.', 'Living in harmony with nature . . .', 'Markov vampires cultivate an image of such decadent elegance that it can be easy to forget they can field a deadly fighting force.', 'Memories of the Harvesttide tragedy festered until they grew into an incarnate rage that set the world ablaze.', 'More than heat and the strength of his arm, it was his faith that gave the blade its unyielding edge.', "Nature bends to the witches' call.", 'Necro-alchemists gained popular support during the Travails, when geist-fueled weapons helped defend towns against mad cultists and Eldrazi monstrosities.', "Nephalia's tides obey an unforgiving moon.", 'Never again would she fear the dusk.', 'Nothing is funnier to a devil than setting someone—anyone—on fire.', 'Nothing remained but a few drifting embers and the smell of smoldering hair.', "Now that it doesn't need to breathe, its hunting ground extends well beyond the sea.", "Occasionally a skaab remembers too much of its former life. Luckily, there's an easy cure.", "Odric resisted the vampire's curse with all his strength. But after a lifetime of fighting monsters, he was doomed to become one himself.", 'Odric took no joy in violence but neither did he mourn for the twisted things he dispatched. All that mattered were the lives he had saved.', 'Olivia set a few villagers loose in the hedge maze as part of the evening\'s "entertainment."', 'Olivia was quick to make an example of any village that refused to pay her blood tithe.', "On Innistrad, one person's windfall usually starts with another person lying face down in the mud.", "Once he'd tasted that dark power, there was no turning back.", 'Passage to the abyss is free, but the return trip will cost you.', 'Priests of the Sigardian Sect travel to the farthest reaches to spread hope and healing, even in the darkest times.', 'RSVP at your own risk.', 'Rather than consort with demons, the Quietus Cult seeks wisdom from the dead.', 'Revenge is a circle without end.', 'Riders chase the fading light recklessly through the mountains, desperate for one last glimpse of day.', "Sensing a plot, Sorin raced to his grandfather's resting-crypt. But someone else had gotten there first.", 'Serpents leave their eggs in the cold and inky depths...', 'She dispatched every challenger with a sickening snap of bone.', 'She faced down a howlpack alone, saving her town at the cost of her life.', 'She finally realized that chaos was meant to run rampant, as was she.', 'She is cursed with visions of monsters and suffering . . . and all her visions come true.', 'She monitors the roads in every province, mapping safe routes through hunting grounds and haunting grounds alike.', 'She patrols the darkness so that others can forget their worries for one bright evening.', 'She spent many years trying to harness chaos.', "She won't rest until she's collected specimens of every bird on Innistrad.", "She's always willing to lend a hand. It just won't be her own.", 'Silverstreak had lost her rider, but not her instinct to help humankind.', 'Since her passing, many more travelers have made it home alive.', 'Skirsdag cultists believe that the right poison "purifies" a tainted soul before it makes its way to Ormendahl.', 'Small talk is a dying art.', 'So many candles. So many flammables. So little time.', "Some cathars succumbed to despair at Avacyn's unmaking. The rest redoubled their efforts to carry out her work.", 'Some geists imitate the lives they left behind. Others follow the dreams they never realized.', 'Some people take that as inspiration.', 'Some wicked souls linger only to consume the warmth of life.', 'Soothing whispers invite travelers to step closer, closer, closer . . . until they vanish soundlessly beneath the surface.', 'Specifics were kept secret, but word quickly spread that the show was a must-see.', 'Stitchers delegate the most important tasks to assistants with a good eye for detail.', 'Stitching is an ever-evolving field, with each new advancement reaching a new height of horror.', 'Swarms of bats poured from Lurenbraum Fortress carrying wedding invitations to vampires of every bloodline.', 'Swirling eddies of ash hide crumbling cliffs, treacherous drops, and the slavering maws of unknown evils.', "Tamil had always wanted a closer look at a geist's lantern. Now he had an eternity to study one.", "Teferi stepped calmly into the fray. Suddenly the sun paused in the sky and the werewolves' snarls froze on their faces.", 'Terms like "safe route" and "cleared district" are a source of dark humor to the cathars who patrol the ruins of Thraben.', 'The Dawnhart survivors welcome recruits of all shapes and sizes.', 'The Falkenrath progenitor was a vicious falconer, and the line is quick to remind others of its heritage.', 'The Quietus Cult holds their grim ceremonies in the dark places where unburied dead litter the ground.', 'The Voldaren have begun demanding blood offerings from the villagers in their territory. Their agents arrive from the sky to collect the ceremonial bowls in eerie silence.', 'The Voldaren torture pits are so expansive that prisoners have a nasty tendency to be forgotten for years.', 'The bones of doomed ships jut out from the muck while the bones of their sailors molder below.', 'The cathars arrived at the abandoned lab to find many of the unfinished projects gnawing on one another.', 'The cathars fell like leaves as Tovolar himself joined the fray.', 'The cause remained unclear, but the fact was undeniable: nights were lengthening faster than in any autumn past.', 'The ceremonial "incense" was a concoction of Edgar\'s own design, a precise blend of blood from his favorite human lineages.', 'The chaplain would perhaps have found some small comfort had he known that the replacement window would be named in his honor.', 'The debased remnants of the Falkenrath bloodline prowl the passes near their ruined castles.', "The door to her home survived the fires of the Malignus. Now it's her greatest weapon.", 'The elite cathars of the Parish-Blades train in all manner of techniques designed to delay and frustrate the beasts that hunt the crossways.', "The evidence was overwhelming. Tovolar's howlpack was getting bolder, smarter, and stronger.", 'The folk of Kessig build up their courage by burning effigies of the things they fear.', 'The foulest of fowl.', 'The hunters spent the evening celebrating their kill and the rest of the night running from it.', 'The legacy of evil lives on.', 'The local gossips swore Nesmith lost his hands in a fight with a werewolf.', 'The merchant did guarantee the new bait would bring in something big.', 'The most dangerous place to be in Kessig is alone.', "The mushrooms growing in the wolves' fur possess curative properties incredible enough to tempt many alchemists into risking their lives to track one down.", 'The new hire proved more than enough to replace the three farmhands who disappeared the week before.', 'The next day, the executioner was found with ashen handprints on his throat.', 'The recruits trained in eternal night, fueled by the hope that they might one day see the sun again.', 'The red envelopes guarantee safe passage through the Lurenbraum barrier. Olivia left strict instructions: no invitation, no entry, no exceptions.', 'The roots preserved the armor for a hundred years, safeguarding it for a traveler in need.', 'The soft creak of trees in the wind is not always cause for comfort.', 'The sound of the trumpet is both warning and comfort: it tells of approaching danger but also reminds the village folk that someone is there to stand against it.', 'The stitcher died years ago, but her dutiful assistant still keeps the laboratory well stocked.', 'The stranger spoke to no one, and the townspeople gladly returned the favor.', "The surviving militia members reunited with their fallen comrades sooner than they'd hoped.", "The third step in creating a skaab requires draining the body of blood and replacing it with *viscus vitae*, a mixture of angel's blood and lamp oil.", 'The towers and catwalks of the Voldaren fortress are lit by the lanterns of geists endlessly seeking a way out.', 'The villagers feared him. The cathars scorned him. Only in the wilds did he find a family that accepted him.', 'The villagers pored through the old storybook, hoping that one of the tales within might hold some clue to saving the fading sun.', 'The weary travelers mistook the flickering lights for a candleguilde pointing the way to Harvesttide. Their relief turned to terror as lightning lit the sky.', "The wolf's captor hid his fear, but he knew someday the runes would fail, the collar would break, and the wolf would remember his face.", "There's only so many times she can take being asked . . .", 'These days, ghouls are the only abundant resource in Thraben.', "These thick-furred wolves have adapted to Stensia's storms, channeling their energy into bursts of supernatural speed.", 'They grow up so fast.', "They weren't entirely wrong.", 'Things buried on Innistrad rarely seem to stay that way.', 'Though their work is widely reviled, stitchers see themselves as being on the cutting edge of science.', "To Olivia's guests, a welcome. To everyone else, a warning.", 'To most, a terrifying apparition. To a necro-alchemist, a potent fuel source.', "To restore the day-night balance, the Celestus mechanism's Sungold Lock must be reunited with its long-lost key.", 'Tomorrow a new village, and new victims.', "Tovolar's howl of command was too much to resist, even for Arlinn's own loyal pack.", "Tovolar's howlpack had scattered, but the Dire-Strain survivors were still on the hunt.", "Tracking it isn't the hard part.", 'Travelers in the Somberwald scan the ground for werewolves and other threats, unaware of what lurks above.', 'Under the light of an unnatural moon, it walked out on legs of straw with joints of hinges ripped from the barn doors.', "Val didn't know what the silent geist was offering . . .", 'Vampires from every bloodline mingled together, all swelling with pride to be seen at the event of the century.', "Were it not for the cultists' fatal curiosity, the terrible machine might have lain dormant for decades more.", 'When Harold ran from the wolves, the others called him a coward.', 'When Kaya saved her village, Berit realized even vampires could be killed. When she brought one down herself, she realized she had found her calling.', "When Tovolar's howl sounded from the woods, it was answered from the heart of the festival.", 'When he could no longer carry on, he imparted his strength to the one who took up his duty.', 'When human corpses are in short supply, stitchers get creative.', 'When the defenses around Lurenbraum Fortress faltered, the Crimson Ballroom received some unexpected guests.', 'While the Dawnhart witches focus their magic on nature and community, other covens consort with devils and twist the elements to their will.', "Widow Weber's new scarecrow seemed to attract more crows than it scared off.", "Witch, werewolf, and cathar stood shoulder to shoulder around the Sungold Lock at the center of the ritual, ready to stop Tovolar's assault—or die trying.", 'With House Voldaren ascendant, some members of the Stromkirk line took it upon themselves to "borrow" from the blood tithes.', 'With Olivia distracted, Sigarda tore free from her bindings and summoned her Host of Herons.', "With Thraben's army recalled to its city walls, outlying villages were left to fend for themselves.", 'With every arm in sight broken, she turned her attention to the furniture.', 'With no guards to be seen, the cobbled streets of Gatstaf echoed with howls.', 'With the cycles of day and night unspooled, the twisted sway of the moon only grew. And grew.', 'With their usual prey scared off by werewolves, the wolves of the Ulvenwald adopted inventive new hunting techniques.', 'Wolves that feast on zombie flesh and survive carry the foul diseases of the dead wherever they roam.', "You don't have to outrun the werewolf; you only have to outrun your fellow guard.", 'Young vampires gorge themselves at every meal, but their elders have learned to savor the smallest bite.']
artist: ['Aaron J. Riley', 'Aaron Miller', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alessandra Pisano', 'Alex Brock', 'Alex Negrea', 'Alexander Mokhov', 'Alix Branwyn', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anato Finnstark', 'Andrea Radeck', 'Andreas Zafiratos', 'Andrew Mar', 'Andrey Kuzinskiy', 'Anna Christenson', 'Anna Fehr', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Antonio José Manzanedo', 'April Prime', 'Artur Treffner', 'Aurore Folny', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Billy Christian', 'Bram Sels', 'Brent Hollowell', 'Brian Valeza', 'Bryan Sola', 'Caio Monteiro', 'Campbell White', 'Caroline Gariba', 'Chris Cold', 'Chris Ostrowski', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Colin Boyer', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cristi Balanescu', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'Darren Tan', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Auden Nash', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Denman Rooke', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Dominik Mayer', 'Donato Giancola', 'E. M. Gist', 'Eelis Kyttanen', 'Ekaterina Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Wilkerson', 'Evyn Fong', 'Fajareka Setiawan', 'Fariba Khamseh', 'Fesbra', 'Filip Burburan', 'Forrest Imel', 'Francisco Miyara', 'G-host Lee', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Igor Krstic', 'Ilse Gort', 'Irina Nordsol', 'Iris Compiet', 'Isis', 'Izzy', 'Jake Murray', 'James Ryman', 'Jarel Threat', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jodie Muir', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Di Giovanni', 'John Stanko', 'Jokubas Uogintas', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Joshua Raphael', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Justine Cruz', 'Justyna Dura', 'Kari Christensen', 'Karl Kopinski', "Kasia 'Kafis' Zielińska", 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Khurrum', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Kim Sokol', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Leanna Crossan', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Liiga Smilshkalne', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Lorenzo Mastroianni', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Manuel Castañón', 'Marcela Medeiros', 'Maria Zolotukhina', 'Marie Magny', 'Mark Behm', 'Marta Nael', 'Martina Fačková', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Micah Epstein', 'Miguel Mercado', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Jordana', 'Mila Pesic', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Muhammad Firdaus', 'Naomi Baker', 'Nicholas Elias', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils Hamm', 'Néstor Ossandón Leal', 'Olena Richards', 'Olivier Bernard', 'Oriana Menendez', 'Ovidio Cartagena', 'PINDURSKI', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Pauline Voss', 'Piotr Foksowicz', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Rovina Cai', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Sam Guay', 'Sam Rowan', 'Sam White', 'Sarah Finnigan', 'Scott Murphy', 'Sean Murray', 'Sean Sevestre', 'Sebastian Giacobino', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Suzanne Helmigh', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tomas Duchek', 'Tran Nguyen', 'Tuan Duong Chu', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Uriah Voth', 'Valera Lutfullina', 'Viko Menezes', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wei Wei', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yigit Koroglu', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zara Alfonso', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros']
